  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacities for Green, Inclusive Economic Growth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This one-year project initiation plan aims to prepare the foundation for a NIM project to be implemented from 2025-2028 that with the goal to strengthen capacities of institutions to develop and implement gender responsive national and local development plans, which are linked to budgets and supported by data for enhanced productivity and improved local economic development; It also aims to enhance capacities of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) to access finance, digital and business</narrative>
  </description>
